                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "BwvP1",
                                      "name": "Why Take This Class?",
                                      "fill": "#ffffffff",
                                      "content": "Why Take This Class?",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.5555555555555556,
                                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                      "fontSize": 27,
                                      "fontWeight": "700"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "frame",
                                  "id": "dQrZM",
                                  "x": 490,
                                  "y": 0,
                                  "name": "Margin",
                                  "width": 490,
                                  "stroke": {
                                    "align": "inside",
                                    "thickness": 1
                                  },
                                  "layout": "vertical",
                                  "padding": [
                                    0,
                                    0,
                                    0,
                                    20
                                  ],
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "frame",
                                      "id": "VqgGw",
                                      "name": "Paragraph",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "stroke": {
                                        "align": "inside",
                                        "thickness": 1
                                      },
                                      "layout": "vertical",
                                      "gap": 24,
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "RbO6l",
                                          "name": "Creating and bringing a 3D character to life is a complex process filled with unknowns. Gaps in knowledge can leave you stuck, and it's even tougher trying to fill in those gaps with fragments of knowledge scattered across the web. The more interconnected the pipeline, the harder it is to know which gap is holding you back.",
                                          "fill": "#e0e0e0ff",
                                          "content": "Creating and bringing a 3D character to life is a complex\nprocess filled with unknowns. Gaps in knowledge can leave you\nstuck, and it's even tougher trying to fill in those gaps with\nfragments of knowledge scattered across the web. The more\ninterconnected the pipeline, the harder it is to know which gap\nis holding you back.",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.5384615008412508,
                                          "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                          "fontSize": 15.600000381469727,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "g25E8",
                                          "name": "This course addresses that with a no-gap, end-to-end process spanning Blender fundamentals, character modeling, rigging, animation, and Unity export. A key part of this is artistic benchmarking: a method for continuously evaluating and closing the gap between your model and the stylized look you're targeting. Every stage is designed so your modeling decisions carry through rigging and animation into the game engine.",
                                          "fill": "#e0e0e0ff",
                                          "content": "This course addresses that with a no-gap, end-to-end process\nspanning Blender fundamentals, character modeling, rigging,\nanimation, and Unity export. A key part of this is artistic\nbenchmarking: a method for continuously evaluating and\nclosing the gap between your model and the stylized look\nyou're targeting. Every stage is designed so your modeling\ndecisions carry through rigging and animation into the game\nengine.",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.5094339984781997,
                                          "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                          "fontSize": 15.899999618530273,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
