                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "cfnOQ",
                                          "name": "Model with the full pipeline in mind so your topology supports rigging and proportions hold up in animation. Design, topology, rigging, and animation are treated as one connected process, not as separate steps.",
